# Build context exclusions for `docker build .` (repo root context).
#
# DEVIATION NOTE (documented per controller carry-over #3, see
# task-20-report.md "Deviations"): carry-over #3 says the frontend SOURCE
# should be excluded ("only dist/ is needed post-build"). Taken completely
# literally that would break this Dockerfile's stage-1 UI build, which
# builds frontend/dist FROM frontend source INSIDE the image (per the
# task-20-brief.md skeleton) -- there is no pre-built frontend/dist checked
# into this repo for the image to consume instead. Resolution: exclude the
# frontend build/dependency ARTIFACTS that aren't needed as build input
# (frontend/node_modules -- reinstalled fresh via `npm ci` in the ui stage;
# any stray local frontend/dist) while keeping the actual frontend source
# (src/, public/, index.html, package*.json, vite.config.js) that stage 1
# requires to produce dist/. The *final* runtime image never touches
# frontend source at all -- stage 2 only ever copies `/ui/dist` from stage
# 1 via `COPY --from=ui`, so the literal "only dist/ is needed" claim is
# true of the final image, just not of the build context.

# --- VCS / tooling ---
.git
.github
.dvc/cache
.dvc/tmp
.superpowers

# --- Python virtualenvs / caches ---
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/

# --- Node ---
**/node_modules
frontend/dist

# --- Training: not needed at serve time (Dockerfile only installs core/ +
# backend/; the model weights it needs are already baked into
# backend/models/, not re-derived from training/ at image build time) ---
training/

# --- Backend tests: not shipped in the runtime image ---
backend/tests/

# --- Root-level test suite / dev-only tooling ---
tests/
scripts/
requirements-dev.txt
pytest.ini

# --- W&B local run artifacts ---
wandb/

# --- Docs / repo meta (not needed at runtime) ---
docs/
NEXT-STEPS.md
CLAUDE.md
*.md
!README.md

# --- OS cruft ---
.DS_Store

# NOTE: deliberately NOT excluded -- the runtime image needs these:
#   backend/models/*.onnx     (DVC-tracked, present on disk in this worktree)
#   backend/samples/**/video.mp4  (DVC-tracked, present on disk in this worktree)
#   backend/app/, backend/__init__.py, backend/requirements.txt
#   core/shuttlesense_core/, core/pyproject.toml
#   frontend/src/, frontend/public/, frontend/index.html,
#   frontend/package*.json, frontend/vite.config.js (needed by ui stage)
